# Plugin: Test-Driven Development Adapter

Purpose:
  Adapt Superpowers TDD skill for SDDRA QA chain.

Source:
  D:\Tasks\ai_code\example_project\tmp\external-repo-audit\repo-01\skills\test-driven-development\SKILL.md

Original:
  RED-GREEN-REFACTOR cycle
  Iron Law: NO PRODUCTION CODE WITHOUT A FAILING TEST FIRST

Adapted for SDDRA:
  Mapped to QA chain stages:
    RED   -> TS (Test Suite) - write failing test
    GREEN -> BE (Backend) - minimal code to pass
    REFACTOR -> QA (Quality Assurance) - clean up

  Iron Law adapted:
    NO CODE IN project/ WITHOUT FAILING TEST FIRST

  Integration:
    - TS stage in feature/bugfix/refactor chains
    - Test requirements from decisions/
    - Verification criteria from DEC-XXX.sdd

  Token tracking:
    - Test writing: ~2000 tokens
    - Test execution: ~1000 tokens
    - Refactor: ~1500 tokens

Usage:
  Referenced by:
    .sdd/chains/feature.sdd (TS stage)
    .sdd/chains/bugfix.sdd (TS stage)
    .sdd/chains/refactor.sdd (TS stage)

  Triggers:
    - Task enters TS stage
    - New feature implementation
    - Bug fix implementation

State: Adapted
